<template>
  <j-page class="store-page catalog-page">
    <main>
      <section class="catalog-hero" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
        <div class="catalog-hero__copy">
          <j-chip class="status-chip status-chip--official">Official catalog preview</j-chip>
          <h1 id="catalog-title">Ready-to-run applications, with trust you can inspect.</h1>
          <p>
            Discover NexRun application packages with declared resources, secrets, storage,
            compatibility, and verification evidence before anything reaches your host.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <j-button class="primary-action" variant="filled" to="#featured">Explore source kits</j-button>
            <j-button class="secondary-action" variant="text" to="/security">How verification works</j-button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <j-card class="assurance-card">
          <j-card-section>
            <span class="eyebrow">Every published release</span>
            <ul class="assurance-list">
              <li><j-icon class="glyph-icon" aria-hidden="true">#</j-icon><span>Immutable SHA-256 identity</span></li>
              <li><j-icon class="glyph-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</j-icon><span>Explicit publisher trust</span></li>
              <li><j-icon class="glyph-icon" aria-hidden="true">E</j-icon><span>Install and conformance evidence</span></li>
              <li><j-icon class="glyph-icon" aria-hidden="true">R</j-icon><span>Visible runtime requirements</span></li>
            </ul>
          </j-card-section>
        </j-card>
      </section>

      <section class="catalog-section" id="featured" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Seed catalog</span>
            <h2 id="featured-title">Official source kits</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Reviewed NexRun examples awaiting the immutable publishing pipeline.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="package-grid">
          <j-card class="package-card package-card--featured">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="package-card__topline">
                <span class="package-icon package-icon--mysql" aria-hidden="true">MY</span>
                <div class="package-badges">
                  <j-badge class="trust-badge">Official</j-badge>
                  <j-badge class="preview-badge">Source kit</j-badge>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="package-publisher">Nextera</span>
                <h3>MySQL</h3>
                <p>MySQL 8.4 with fenced persistent storage, secret delivery, health checks, and a restore-drill runbook.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="package-meta">
                <j-chip>OCI</j-chip>
                <j-chip>2 GiB RAM</j-chip>
                <j-chip>2 volumes</j-chip>
                <j-chip>1 secret</j-chip>
              </div>
            </j-card-section>
            <j-card-actions>
              <j-button class="card-action" variant="filled" to="/apps/nextera/mysql">Review package</j-button>
            </j-card-actions>
          </j-card>

          <j-card class="package-card">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="package-card__topline">
                <span class="package-icon package-icon--web" aria-hidden="true">WEB</span>
                <div class="package-badges">
                  <j-badge class="trust-badge">Official</j-badge>
                  <j-badge class="preview-badge">Source kit</j-badge>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="package-publisher">Nextera</span>
                <h3>Static SPA</h3>
                <p>Serve a compiled single-page application directly from NexRun—no container or web-server sidecar.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="package-meta">
                <j-chip>Static</j-chip>
                <j-chip>No secrets</j-chip>
                <j-chip>Linux</j-chip>
              </div>
            </j-card-section>
            <j-card-actions>
              <span class="muted-action">Detail page coming next</span>
            </j-card-actions>
          </j-card>

          <j-card class="package-card">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="package-card__topline">
                <span class="package-icon package-icon--dobase" aria-hidden="true">DB</span>
                <div class="package-badges">
                  <j-badge class="trust-badge">Official</j-badge>
                  <j-badge class="preview-badge">Source kit</j-badge>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="package-publisher">Nextera</span>
                <h3>Dobase</h3>
                <p>Durable single-writer deployment with scoped secrets, persistent data, backups, and production gates.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="package-meta">
                <j-chip>OCI</j-chip>
                <j-chip>8 GiB RAM</j-chip>
                <j-chip>4 secrets</j-chip>
              </div>
            </j-card-section>
            <j-card-actions>
              <span class="muted-action">Publishing blocked on image digest</span>
            </j-card-actions>
          </j-card>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="catalog-section trust-callout" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Trust is a policy</span>
          <h2 id="trust-title">A signature is the beginning of verification—not the end.</h2>
          <p>
            NexRun checks content integrity and signer possession. The Store adds publisher identity,
            immutable release metadata, evidence, and an explicit level of endorsement.
          </p>
        </div>
        <j-button class="secondary-action" variant="text" to="/security">Read the trust model</j-button>
      </section>

      <section class="catalog-section lifecycle-section" aria-labelledby="lifecycle-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">From source to instance</span>
            <h2 id="lifecycle-title">One transparent release path</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lifecycle-grid">
          <j-card><j-card-section><span>01</span><h3>Validate</h3><p>Strict IDEL parsing and declared capability review.</p></j-card-section></j-card>
          <j-card><j-card-section><span>02</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Constrained build with signed provenance and immutable output.</p></j-card-section></j-card>
          <j-card><j-card-section><span>03</span><h3>Verify</h3><p>Install, health, restart, and evidence gates on a clean host.</p></j-card-section></j-card>
          <j-card><j-card-section><span>04</span><h3>Deploy</h3><p>The user reviews requirements before NexRun creates an instance.</p></j-card-section></j-card>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </j-page>
</template>
